{"reviews":[{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Saves so much space on the countertop","x":"Old picture. My holder now holds my straightener in one tin, curler in another and hair dryer in the third tin. The front holds all of my hair products and a handheld mirror. I would say in total, the front of my holder holds 9-10 different products. This saves me so much space on my dresser top. It also matches the top of my dresser which was a huge bonus. If you\u2019re looking for a nice way to store your hair products this is a great value for the money.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Nice quality item","x":"It is exactly what I was needing.  Got new hair dryer and irons that were higher quality so didn\u2019t want them to be thrown in a basket, this holder has done the job.  Holds everything I need when I am getting ready.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-2","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap piece of junk","x":"Being wood and with a price of $35 I expected this to be a sturdy organizer, but I was VERY wrong. When I removed it from the box it was already broken! You can tell it has been banged or dropped judging by the scratch / dent on it. It's hard to show in pictures, but that whole side now moves and has cracks running down it. On top of the poor quality of this product, it's not at all what I expected. It's extremely lightweight and cheap wood, much more unfinished than it looks in the pictures, an","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Nice quality, nice price!","x":"This is great! Started trying to curl my hair during the stay at home time. I have several curling irons and a 10 month old kitten that is too much help! In order to safely store my irons while they are hot I looked for a solution. The stainless liners were the answer! The quality is very nice and functional.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-4","r":1.0,"t":"Ordered Two, BOTH Were Cracked","x":"Ordered first one which was cracked in two places with exposed nail fasteners. Returned and received 2nd one very quickly, but also cracked (no fasteners showing). I agree these look like a high school wood shop project. Rough wood and no sealant. One review said mold set in. Both are being returned.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-5","r":3.0,"t":"Cute but top is cracked","x":"I was looking forward to getting this to try to clean up my bathroom countertop, but when I received it the top has two cracks across the top. Will have to return, I am afraid over time the cracks will allow for the cups to fall.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-6","r":4.0,"t":"What the clutter","x":"I was completely fed up with the ness on my bathroom counter.  This little joy cleaned it right up.  The only negative is that the metal inserts should be glued in where they don't come out when you pull your items out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase!","x":"I love this in my rv! Keeps everything organized without taking up so much space! And no worries on my straightener to burn the countertop or sink.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-8","r":4.0,"t":"It's really nice but could be better","x":"You can clearly tell it was painted half hazardly but other than that it's great for the price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Cute","x":"Cute wooden holder and does what it\u2019s supposed to do. Love the rustic look of it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-10","r":3.0,"t":"Verify dries will fit in cups before ordering","x":"The cups are too small for my dryer.  It would be better with larger cups","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-11","r":3.0,"t":"Meh","x":"Have to take the cups out to put anything other than curling iron in it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!!","x":"I bought this for work. I am a hair stylists and use many clippers, trimmers. The cords were always getting tangled. This product helped!! No more cord tangles and I have room for products, water bottle and disinfectants.. I am going to get another one for home..","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-13","r":5.0,"t":"I love this!","x":"This is exactly what I needed. It holds the blow dryer, straightener large curling iron and the small one fits on the little shelf.  Looks nice too, I appreciate the organization that it brings as well as the good look to my bathroom counter.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-14","r":5.0,"t":"I do love the look but..,","x":"My curling wands don\u2019t really fit that great, the cups aren\u2019t really very deep but it\u2019s ok because it\u2019s up against my mirror. It\u2019s sturdy and pretty as heck though. Got the matching makeup one too which I LOVE.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-15","r":2.0,"t":"Okay but the smell..","x":"The product material seems sturdy but it smells, especially if you take out the cups that come with it. Also, seems to be pricey for a having only 3 spaces for your hot tools, and a small space for other stuff.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-16","r":3.0,"t":"Its ok, but nor for busy bathroom.","x":"Not made for busy bathroom. Perhaps vanity, but not bathroom with any water (toothbrush) or moisture. Not sealed. Any little bit of water causes mold to grow. Had to throw both out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-17","r":4.0,"t":"Hair dryer holder is made of good quality wooden material.","x":"The storage cup inserts are removable which makes for easy cleaning. Good item for organizing hair products such as hair dryer, curling iron, flat irons and more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Saves space","x":"Looks so nice on hair station.  Holds my hair tools and a few products.  Love the metal holders inside the wood because you can take them out and sterilize.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect - solved my disarrayissue.","x":"This is a good quality product, stylish and totally solved my storage/convenience issues with all of my hair styling products. Very happy with my purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-20","r":3.0,"t":"Useful but finish lacks lustre","x":"This product arrived with a white coating on the finish. Scribed it and Most came off but I did not like it. Disappointed! Storage capacity is adequate.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-21","r":5.0,"t":"ADORABLE","x":"I love this piece! My hairdryer, straightener, and curling wand fit perfectly! It is great for the price and goes fantastically with my farmhouse decor!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"Love it! I was afraid it'd be cheap, nope! Looks great, works efficiently, hold all I need and doesn't take up all the room on the counter!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-23","r":2.0,"t":"Better for hair dryers","x":"They should make the holes deeper! My hair straightener falls out,  my curling wand is a no go, hair dryer fits well. Super cute though!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B08K2RNJBJ-24","r":3.0,"t":"Cup holders not that deep","x":"I was upset that the cup holders for the heating tools pop out and are not that deep. Otherwise the unit it self is nice and sturdy","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say it does a great job organizing and saving space on the countertop or dresser.","cites":[1,2,7,8,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the look and quality, calling it cute, sturdy, and nice for the price.","cites":[2,4,9,10,14,15]},{"text":"A common complaint is that items arrive cracked or broken, sometimes more than once.","cites":[3,5,6]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the cups too small or shallow, so larger dryers or wands don't fit well.","cites":[11,12,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the metal inserts come out and should be glued in.","cites":[7]}]},"qa":[]}